DTEND:20260508T000000
UID:1a0c8eb9c6811003e0b5c8f0a5a41278@adoberoadwines.com
DESCRIPTION:Start your weekend off right! Join us every Friday in May for 
 Happy Hour at Adobe Road Winery in Downtown Petaluma. Enjoy special 10% of
 f pricing on wines by the glass from 3:30 PM to 5:30 PM. Stop by before go
 ing to dinner\, a movie or show! Even better\, Inside Track Wine Club memb
 ers enjoy additional club member pricing as well. Walk-ins welcome\, call 
 (707) 774-6699 or use Tock for reservations.
LOCATION:Adobe Road Tasting Room\, 6 Petaluma Blvd. N - Suite A1 Petaluma\
 , CA
URL:https://adoberoadwines.com/events/may-friday-happy-hour/
X-SOURCE:Adobe Road Winery
END:VEVENT
