BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Live Music – Peter Filice
DTSTART:20260509T000000
DTEND:20260509T000000
UID:bf296bd4bcfe7d26d52bf02b9098c30c@adoberoadwines.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Saturday acoustic live music set at Adob
 e Road Winery in downtown Petaluma. Sip on award-winning wines while enjoy
 ing talented local musicians in a warm and inviting atmosphere. Choose fro
 m wines by the glass or bottle to discover new favorites. Reserve your spo
 t on Tock and make it a memorable night of great music\, fine wine\, and g
 ood company! About Peter Filice A lifelong vocalist and guitar player\, Pe
 ter has been in the Bay Area music scene since the 1990’s. He was vocali
 st and guitarist for the South Bay band OTR\, winners of the KFOX Last Ban
 d Standing competition in 2010\, and subsequently\, in 2015\, started a ve
 ry successful acoustic act\, P.S. Acoustic Music\, performing in solo\, du
 o\, and trio formats at numerous South Bay venues. He also has performed i
 n tribute shows to Creedence Clearwater Revival\, Three Dog Night\, Linda 
 Ronstadt\, and his own Simon and Garfunkel tribute. Having recently reloca
 ted to Petaluma\, Peter is now performing at many North Bay venues as well
  as maintaining shows in the South Bay.
LOCATION:Adobe Road Tasting Room\, 6 Petaluma Blvd. N - Suite A1 Petaluma\
 , CA
URL:https://adoberoadwines.com/events/live-music-peter-filice-may-9-2026/
X-SOURCE:Adobe Road Winery
END:VEVENT
